                                                           ========== Zeek and Arkime for  Data Analysis ===============

 In cybersecurity and network monitoring, Zeek, Arkime, Wireshark, and Elasticsearch each play a distinct role in capturing, analyzing, and storing network traffic, rather than competing directly with one another.



        Network traffic  (ya aapki pcap files)
                │
       ┌────────┴─────────┐
       ▼                  ▼
     ZEEK            ARKIME CAPTURE
  (analysis)          (recording)
       │               │         │
  log files        session      raw packets
 (conn, http,      records      (PCAP files
  dns...)             │          disk par)
       │              │              │
  Filebeat /          ▼              │
  Logstash ──►  ELASTICSEARCH  ◄─────┘ (sirf location yaad rakhta hai)
 (data bhejne        │
  wala madadgar)     │
              ┌──────┴────────┐
              ▼               ▼
       KIBANA/Dashboards   ARKIME VIEWER
       (Zeek logs ka       (browser UI: search,
        search aur graph)   packets download)
                                 │
                                 ▼  pcap download
                             WIRESHARK
                       (ek session ka gehra analysis)


